    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Quarterstaff with a pale hardwood shaft, alternating leather grip bands, a pink central grip section and brass ferrules and end caps at both ends. The staff is straight in every orthographic view and both ends are capped and finished, so either end can be presented as the striking end. Free-standing weapon, unrigged. Materials score 4 for flat wood and leather colour.",
